{"segs": ["PA_ja_69:0.4", "PA_ja_69:1.1"], "en": "9. The Visavantajātaka “Fie on that poison I have vomited up,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_69:1.2"], "en": "for the sake of which I [would lose my life];”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_69:1.3"], "en": "\"I would rather vomit it back up;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_69:1.4"], "en": "death is better for me than life.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_69:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the ninth Jātaka, the Visavantajātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
